Model weights are downloaded at runtime from the Hugging Face Hub and are
not included in this repository.

The evaluation labels in evals/labels.json are derived from the annotations
of the AMI Meeting Corpus (CC BY 4.0, https://groups.inf.ed.ac.uk/ami/corpus/).
The corpus audio and transcripts are fetched at evaluation time and are not
included in this repository.
